A. Any person may submit an application for a variance from the provisions of this ordinance in accordance with the procedures set forth in Land Development Code Section 10.160. The application should include, but not be limited to, evidence about the following:
1. How the proposed design and appearance of the LUMINAIRE are superior;
2. How LIGHT TRESSPASS and GLARE will be limited;
